{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------------------------<br>Game plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventurer &quot;Ron&quot; led an expedition team to investigate the vortex of the perennial storm, and the ship disintegrated in the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking up, he found himself drifting to an isolated island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking up, the village chief told him that this was the &quot;Happy Island&quot; and that if he wanted to leave, he would have to wait for the next &quot;Sacrificial Day&quot;, so Ron stayed there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He met several beautiful women here, including the village chief's daughter, a charming widow, a mysterious goddess, a newlywed young woman, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the help of these female companions, he successfully solved the secrets of the storm on the island and the ancient treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[1] Free movement around the island, follow the player's operation and wander around;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[2] Daily gameplay such as fishing, scavenging, Planting, Cooking, Digging;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[3] Mini-games are interspersed in each story process to entertain players;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[4] Rich dynamic CG animations, every detail is full of dynamics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Margaret: The daughter of the village chief, full of yearning for the outside world, with long purple hair and a curvy figure.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668560/extras/1df8237408a757b296ffdc3c03926ef9.poster.avif?t=1751622259\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-moti